<newsitem itemid="167834" id="root" date="1996-11-05" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Anglian Water first half pre-tax rises 5.5pct.</title>
<headline>Anglian Water first half pre-tax rises 5.5pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 46.7	   vs     41.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  10.2	   vs	8.9</p>
<p> Pretax		     132.7	   vs    125.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   413.3	   vs    372.2</p>
<p> Operating result	 165.0	   vs    149.0</p>
<p> Exceptional		  0.4	   vs	0.9</p>
<p> Interest		    32.7	   vs     24.1</p>
<p> Tax			    6.9	   vs	6.0</p>
<p> Net taxed		  125.8	   vs    119.8</p>
<p> Retained profit	   98.3	   vs     95.9</p>
<p> Pay date		   February 17 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  December 17 1996</p>
<p>NOTE - &quot;The regulated business has turned in an excellent half year performance,&quot; Anglian Water Plc said. &quot;Our dividend increase reflects the continued improvement being made in the efficiency of the regulated business and the board's confidence that further cost savings can be achieved.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
